kattri (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Patch release.
  * Bump wasmtime to 50.0.3 for RUSTSEC-2026-0566 through RUSTSEC-2026-0569
    (host memory growth through empty async writes, an abort in builds without
    the threads feature, a stale GC heap base pointer, and a panic in
    Caller::get_module_export).
  * Add a code-rendered benchmark comparison to the README.

