kattri (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First stable release.
  * SyncPlay group pause, seek and unpause reach the group while stream-only
    playback reporting is disabled; a queued start joins at the current
    position.
  * Two-client SyncPlay drift measured p95 77 ms and max 321 ms, with no sample
    over the 500 ms threshold.

