kattri (0.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * LAN server discovery, jellyfin:// deep links, administrator user
    management and SyncPlay/shared playback.
  * Custom request headers bound to the server origin; optional combined home
    shelves and per-series hiding.
  * Signed update manifest fetch with bounded transport; Wasmtime advisories
    patched.
  * Custom accent, background and surface theme colors.
  * Download permission follows the server policy; batched download worker.
  * Playback redraw, control and group-speed hardening; macOS URL dispatch.
  * Plain HTTP to .local names is refused; only .localhost and literal
    loopback/private addresses are trusted.
  * Windows installation smoke uses a window-only launch mode and passes.

